WHAT THIS IS

A native macOS implementation of the VESC serial protocol, written for
interoperability with VESC-derived motor controllers. It currently targets
AK-series actuators; the protocol layer itself is not specific to them.

The protocol originates in the VESC Project (vedderb/bldc and vesc_tool,
GPLv3). See CREDITS.md.

