HOW THE PROTOCOL WAS ESTABLISHED

The protocol behaviour documented here was established through interoperability
analysis: observing traffic on the wire and confirming behaviour against real
hardware the author owns. Every documented claim carries a marker recording
whether it was measured on hardware or inferred, and superseded conclusions are
kept and labelled rather than deleted.

This work exists so that independently written software can interoperate with
hardware its owner already has. No vendor source code was available to this
project, and no vendor software is redistributed with it.

